#: checks/settings.py:177
msgid ""
"Verifies that Django's CsrfViewMiddleware is enabled. Without it, a "
"malicious page can make the browser of a logged-in administrator send "
"requests to the broker. Add django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware back "
"to MIDDLEWARE in the broker settings."
msgstr ""
"Verifica que o CsrfViewMiddleware de Django está activado. Sen el, unha "
"páxina maliciosa pode facer que o navegador dun administrador que iniciou "
"sesión envíe solicitudes ao axente. Engade "
"django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware de volta a MIDDLEWARE na "
"configuración do axente."

#: checks/settings.py:190
msgid ""
"django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware is not in MIDDLEWARE: cross-site "
"request forgery is not mitigated at the framework level."
msgstr ""
"django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware non está en MIDDLEWARE: a "
"falsificación de solicitudes entre sitios non se mitiga a nivel de marco."

#: checks/settings.py:197
msgid "django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware is active."
msgstr "django.middleware.csrf.CsrfViewMiddleware está activo."

#: checks/settings.py:207
msgid ""
"Verifies that the SQL logger is not at DEBUG when DEBUG is off. At that "
"level every query is written to log/sql.log with its values, including "
"passwords and personal data. Raise the level of the 'django.db.backends' "
"logger in the broker settings."
msgstr ""
"Verifica que o rexistrador SQL non estea en DEBUG cando DEBUG está "
"desactivado. Nese nivel, cada consulta escríbese en log/sql.log cos seus "
"valores, incluíndo contrasinais e datos persoais. Aumenta o nivel do "
"rexistrador 'django.db.backends' na configuración do axente."

#: checks/settings.py:225
msgid ""
"SQL logger 'django.db.backends' is at DEBUG while DEBUG is off: every SQL "
"statement with bound values is being written to log/sql.log on disk."
msgstr ""
"O rexistrador SQL 'django.db.backends' está en DEBUG mentres DEBUG está "
"desactivado: cada instrución SQL con valores vinculados escríbese en log/"
"sql.log no disco."

#: checks/settings.py:232
msgid ""
"SQL logger 'django.db.backends' is not writing bound SQL to disk in "
"production."
msgstr ""
"O rexistrador SQL 'django.db.backends' non escribe SQL vinculado ao disco en "
"produción."

#: checks/settings.py:242
msgid ""
"Verifies that the root and 'uds' loggers are not at DEBUG. DEBUG logs grow "
"fast and may contain sensitive data. Set their level to INFO or higher in "
"the broker settings."
msgstr ""
"Verifica que os rexistradores raíz e 'uds' non estean en DEBUG. Os rexistros "
"de DEBUG medran rápido e poden conter datos confidenciais. Define o seu "
"nivel en INFO ou superior na configuración do axente."

#: checks/settings.py:260
msgid "Root or 'uds' logger is at DEBUG in production (verbose logs on disk)."
msgstr ""
"O rexistrador raíz ou 'uds' está en DEBUG en produción (rexistros detallados "
"no disco)."

#: checks/settings.py:265
msgid "Root and 'uds' loggers are above DEBUG in production."
msgstr "Os rexistradores raíz e 'uds' están por riba de DEBUG en produción."

#: checks/user_services.py:73
msgid ""
"Looks for user services that have been preparing for longer than "
"MAX_INITIALIZING_TIME, or that are ready on the provider but whose actor "
"never reported. Nothing removes them on their own. Check the provider and "
"whether the actor inside the machine can reach the broker; the details list "
"the affected pools."
msgstr ""
"Busca servizos de usuario que levan máis tempo que MAX_INITIALIZING_TIME "
"preparándose ou que estean listos no provedor pero cuxo actor nunca "
"informou. Nada os elimina por si só. Comprobe o provedor e se o actor dentro "
"da máquina pode conectar co corredor; os detalles enumeran os grupos "
"afectados."

